# Optional. Raises the GitHub REST rate limit from 60/hr (unauthenticated)
# to 5,000/hr when building src/lib/agentica.ts's live stats fetch.
# A fine-grained PAT with public-repo read access is enough; not required
# for local dev at normal build frequency. In CI, set as a repo secret —
# GitHub Actions' built-in ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }} works fine here.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
